select public.admin_notify('🚪 D62: sahi darwaza mil gaya — Add account se seedha IG login', 'Owner ne section 2 ka "Add account" button khol liya — dialog: "Add an Instagram account… log into the Instagram account you want to assign a tester role to… only professional accounts… Tokens can only be generated for public Instagram accounts." App roles page par dono IG testers PENDING dikhe (invitations accept nahi hui thi — shayad yahi purani rukawat ki jad thi). Guide: (1) zone_queen_55 ko pehle PUBLIC karo (IG Settings → Account privacy off) kyunki tokens sirf public accounts ke bante hain; (2) dialog me Continue → IG login window me zone_queen_55 ka password → tester invite accept karo → account section 2 me list hoga → Generate token → copy → Drive private file; (3) wahi Add account dohrao mini_esports_official ke liye → token → file; (4) agar Continue par "unable to log in/invitation" ruke to IG app → profile → Settings → Apps and Websites → pending invitation accept karo, phir retry. Is flow me wo toota hua FB dialog bilkul nahi aata. Dono tokens ke baad "codes file ready" → agent server-side hub connect + live DM test.', 'session_end') as notified;
